        "text_benefits": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If allergies or asthma disrupt your nights, <strong>where you breathe</strong> matters. AirTulip Sleep purifies the air at your pillow—not the far corner of the room—so you are not cycling through pollen, dust, and pet dander already in your bedroom.</p><p>That helps reduce exposure to the ultrafine triggers behind <strong>histamine-driven congestion, irritation, and flare-ups</strong>. Many customers report easier overnight breathing and fewer wake-ups tied to <strong>asthma, allergies, and sleep-apnea-related discomfort</strong> when pillow-side air stays clean.</p><p>You get a personal purified bubble while you sleep—<strong>effectively zero particles</strong> in the only zone that counts: where your face and lungs are all night.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md"
          }
        },
        "icon_row_benefits": {
